{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n \\\"邮票|stamp\\\" /home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi /home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp /home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code -g '\"'!**/__pycache__/**'\"'\"","aggregated_output":"/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:72:    Decode the colored 3x3 contour motif into a 16x16 periodic lattice with the motif stamped in maroon at the center.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:175:    center_stamp: motif tiled 2x2 into 6x6, placed at (5,5)-(10,10), fg recolored to maroon(9)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:184:    4. Create 6x6 orange grid, stamp the motif at (r0,c0) with the chosen fg color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:213:#      6x6 stamp, using their original color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:217:#      into the centered 2x2-tiled stamp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:222:#    - The generator caps decoration size at 3 cells. That gives repeated support in the 2x2 center stamp while\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:228:#    - Reusing the whole boolean motif as the center stamp would incorrectly recolor decoration cells to maroon.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:240:#      input color reappears only inside the centered 6x6 stamp. This is directly visible from a few examples because\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:245:#    - Only one extra layer is added, and it is confined to the center stamp. The lattice outside the center stays\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:247:#    - The maroon phase stamp and the decoration layer are disjoint by construction, avoiding ambiguous overpainting.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:250:#      the phase color is interpreted structurally: its shape becomes the orange lattice code plus a maroon stamp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:337:    Decode a two-color 3x3 code patch into the usual phase lattice, then stamp both encoded layers at the center.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_eee78d87_3.txt:353:      other color is local and only survives as a repeated ornament in the centered stamp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/0/code.py:41:#    - Original stamping loop iterated over every non-background destination pixel.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/0/code.py:42:#      In the variant, iterating over all non-background pixels would stamp the same\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/0/code.py:74:#    - The block's top-left corner leaves enough room to stamp the whole sprite.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/0/code.py:157:    - Output the destination rectangle alone, cleared to its background before stamping.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D13/0/code.py:256:def _stamp_state(out: np.ndarray, center: tuple[int, int], color: int, state: str) -> None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D13/0/code.py:383:        _stamp_state(out, center, color, _display_state(state, has_next))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D13/0/code.py:450:def _stamp_token(grid: np.ndarray, center_r: int, center_c: int, color: int, offsets: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D13/0/code.py:622:    _stamp_token(grid, center[0], center[1], color, _STATE_TO_OFFSETS[state])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D13/0/code.py:690:        _stamp_token(input_grid, top_center[0], top_center[1], color, _STATE_TO_OFFSETS[start_state])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:6:    description: \"模板含孔洞(内部有空缺像素)，每个晶格点的stamp根据其相对原点的方向进行翻转(左侧水平翻转、上方垂直翻转、左上两个方向都翻转)。当多个stamp重叠时，重叠像素消失(变为背景色)。原点副本着O色。孔洞的不对称性使翻转后的重叠模式产生明显视觉差异。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:16:    description: \"单例像素间距不均匀(非等间距晶格)，stamp放置后重叠像素消失(变为背景色)，输出网格紧凑裁剪至stamp覆盖区域的最小外接矩形。不均匀间距导致不规则重叠模式，消失后的结果再裁剪输出。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:26:    description: \"原点不由颜色匹配确定，而由位置规则(如最靠近模板的单例像素)确定。stamp采用擦除模式(原点stamp覆盖区域清除为背景色而非着色)。原始单例像素在输出中保留不删除，形成与stamp的对比标记。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:31:    reason: \"三步推理链改变：原点判定(步骤2)、stamp效果(步骤6)、后处理(步骤7)。擦除模式+保留标记形成有趣的'先擦后留'对比效果。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:36:    description: \"模板含孔洞(内部有空缺像素)，原点副本使用模板的补集形状(孔洞填充、原有像素清空)表示。所有stamp以模板重心(而非左上角)为对齐基准点放置。孔洞影响重心位置计算，补集原点产生形态对偶。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:46:    description: \"stamp间距由模板面积决定(如面积的平方根向上取整)，晶格为8-连通(含对角线连接)，stamp以模板重心为对齐基准。三个参数共同决定stamp在网格中的最终位置分布。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:51:    reason: \"间距计算(步骤4)、连通性(步骤3)、基准点(步骤6)三重改变，各自独立可推断但组合后产生独特的stamp分布模式。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:56:    description: \"晶格为8-连通(含对角线连接)，以原点为中心将晶格分为四个象限，各象限stamp按象限旋转(右上0度、左上90度、左下180度、右下270度)。旋转后的stamp若重叠则重叠像素消失(变为背景色)。8-连通的对角线stamp与旋转结合产生复杂的重叠-消失模式。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:66:    description: \"通过连通性匹配确定原点(与模板连通结构相似的标记为原点)，模板含孔洞，各象限stamp按象限旋转。旋转后的孔洞模板在不同象限呈现不同形态，连通性判断需考虑旋转不变性。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:76:    description: \"单例像素间距不均匀(需推断每个方向的实际步长)，模板含孔洞，各晶格点的stamp根据相对原点的方向进行翻转(左侧水平翻转、上方垂直翻转)。不均匀间距需逐个推断偏移量，孔洞不对称使翻转可辨别。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:86:    description: \"原点由位置规则(如最靠近模板的单例像素)确定而非颜色匹配。原点位置的stamp使用模板的补集形状(原有像素位置变为背景、原有背景位置着O色)。其余晶格点正常stamp模板。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:95:    description: \"单例像素间距不均匀(非等间距)，且晶格连通性采用8-连通(允许对角线相邻)。需从不均匀间距中推断晶格结构，对角线方向的stamp放置增加复杂度。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:104:    description: \"模板含孔洞(内部空缺)，stamp采用擦除模式——stamp覆盖区域的已有内容被清除为背景色，但孔洞位置保留原有内容不被擦除。孔洞成为'透视窗'。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:108:    reason: \"孔洞+擦除产生独特语义——擦除时孔洞保留原内容，形成'选择性擦除'效果。推理链步骤4(模板解析)+步骤6(stamp效果)改变。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:112:    name: \"旋转stamp边框原点\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:113:    description: \"各晶格点的stamp进行旋转变换替代重着色来区分原点(原点stamp旋转180度，其他正常)，原点位置的stamp仅保留边框(模板轮廓像素)着O色，内部不填充。旋转的边框vs正常的实心形成视觉对比。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:122:    description: \"原点通过连通性匹配确定(与模板有相同连通结构的标记为原点而非通过颜色匹配)。各象限的stamp按象限旋转(右上0度、左上90度等)。解题者需分析标记的拓扑结构并推断旋转规则。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:126:    reason: \"匹配方式和stamp朝向双重改变。连通性匹配要求分析标记的拓扑结构，象限旋转要求确定相对原点的方位。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:131:    description: \"模板包含2-3种颜色(多色精灵)，stamp时保持多色结构。若多个stamp重叠，后绘制的stamp完全覆盖先绘制的(按晶格点的某种排序决定优先级)。多色使覆盖顺序可辨别(不同颜色层次可见)。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:140:    description: \"stamp采用擦除模式(原点stamp覆盖区域清除为背景色)，但原始单例像素标记在输出中保留不删除。擦除区域中若有原始标记则标记仍可见，形成'先擦后留'的效果。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:144:    reason: \"擦除+保留形成有趣的对比效果，保留的标记成为stamp位置的线索。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:149:    description: \"原点副本使用模板的补集形状(反转实体与空缺，着O色)，其余晶格点的stamp按象限旋转放置。原点的补集形状与旋转后的正常模板形成强烈视觉对比。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:153:    reason: \"原点表现(补集)+普通stamp表现(旋转)双重改变，人类需同时推断补集规则和旋转规则。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:158:    description: \"模板含孔洞(内部空缺)，各晶格点的stamp根据其相对原点的方向进行翻转(左侧水平翻转、上方垂直翻转、左上两个方向都翻转)。孔洞的不对称性使翻转后形态明显不同，便于推断翻转规则。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:167:    description: \"以原点为中心将晶格分为四个象限，各象限stamp按象限旋转。旋转后stamp若重叠则重叠像素消失(变为背景色)。旋转改变stamp形状从而改变重叠区域，消失的位置取决于旋转角度。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:185:    description: \"stamp以模板重心(所有像素坐标的平均值)为对齐基准点(而非左上角)，各象限stamp按象限旋转。重心基准改变stamp的绝对位置，旋转改变stamp的朝向，两者共同决定最终像素分布。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:189:    reason: \"基准点+旋转双重影响stamp放置，重心在旋转后可能不对称(非方形模板)，产生微妙的位置差异。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:194:    description: \"水平方向和垂直方向的晶格间距不等(如水平gunit=2、垂直gunit=3)，各象限的stamp按象限旋转。不等间距使不同象限的stamp分布不对称，与旋转规则结合产生独特图案。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:198:    reason: \"间距不等+象限旋转共同影响stamp放置和朝向，产生高度非对称的输出。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:203:    description: \"原始单例像素在输出中保留不删除(标记位置和颜色不变)，输出网格紧凑裁剪至所有stamp和保留标记的最小外接矩形。保留的标记可能扩大裁剪边界。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:221:    description: \"模板放置在网格边缘(紧贴某条边界)，输出紧凑裁剪。模板的边缘位置使stamp阵列偏向一侧，裁剪后产生非对称边界效果。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:224:    reason: \"确保D15维度覆盖。边缘位置+裁剪的交互在于：边缘stamp分布不对称影响裁剪边界和最终形态。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/des_combo/a395ee82.yaml:229:    description: \"各象限stamp按象限旋转，输出紧凑裁剪至所有stamp的最小外接矩形。旋转改变各stamp的bounding box，使裁剪后的输出形状依赖旋转参数，非对称模板的旋转产生不规则裁剪边界。\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:20:#     - stamping still translates a source sprite so its anchor pixel lands on a marker pixel\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:24:#     - output is the full destination rectangle after stamping from those border anchors\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:41:#       collapse back into the original full-inside stamping behavior\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:49:#       markers, while output stamping is applied afterward and can overwrite those border pixels\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:51:#     - generator enumerates side-specific border positions and accepts only non-overlapping visible stamp\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:56:#       marker sits on an edge and every stamp loses at least one colored cell outside the frame\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:59:#     - visible stamp footprints are forced not to overlap, keeping the output easy to parse\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:60:#     - only 2-3 border markers are used, so even when a stamp colors multiple edge cells, the frame stays\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:77:    - Output is the cropped destination rectangle after clearing it and applying all such border-aligned stamps.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:418:def _visible_stamp_stats(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:449:    \"\"\"Place border markers and build the stamped output frame they imply.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:462:                    visible, clipped = _visible_stamp_stats(patch, sprite[\"anchor_rc\"], (0, mc), dst_h, dst_w, dst_bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:466:                    visible, clipped = _visible_stamp_stats(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:472:                    visible, clipped = _visible_stamp_stats(patch, sprite[\"anchor_rc\"], (mr, 0), dst_h, dst_w, dst_bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:476:                    visible, clipped = _visible_stamp_stats(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D3/1/code.py:506:    \"\"\"Place sprites into the source interior, returning stamped_inner or None.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_58f5dbd5/20260506_214633/gen_4.log:76:    Key insight: The motif acts as a stencil — it's not stamped onto the block but carved out of it as background holes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_58f5dbd5/20260506_214633/gen_4.log:527:    content: each 5x5 block carved by stamping its matching motif (centered at offset (1,1) within 5x5) as bg holes; motif cells -> bg, rest keep block color; blocks packed with 1-cell gaps preserving input row/col order; 1-cell bg border\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_58f5dbd5/20260506_214633/gen_4.log:2271:    Key insight: The motif acts as a stencil — it's not stamped onto the block but carved out of it as background holes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/