aces.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D12/2/code.py:133:    - Fake sources also touch the ring, but include a filled 2x2 elbow stamp in their shape.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D12/2/code.py:137:    - Only ring-touching components without a 2x2 stamp are projected inward.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D12/2/code.py:142:      while stamped traces are decoys and must be discarded before any endpoint pairing.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D12/2/code.py:479:    stamp = (R + (1 if is_top else -1), C + (1 if is_left else -1))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D12/2/code.py:480:    return outer + [stamp]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_58f5dbd5/20260506_214633/gen_33.log:76:    Key insight: The motif acts as a stencil — it's not stamped onto the block but carved out of it as background holes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_58f5dbd5/20260506_214633/gen_33.log:527:    content: each 5x5 block carved by stamping its matching motif (centered at offset (1,1) within 5x5) as bg holes; motif cells -> bg, rest keep block color; blocks packed with 1-cell gaps preserving input row/col order; 1-cell bg border\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_58f5dbd5/20260506_214633/gen_33.log:665:    Key insight: The motif acts as a stencil — it's not stamped onto the block but carved out of it as background holes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_7b3084d4/20260502_052251/gen_16.log:3105:    # stamp base first\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_7b3084d4/20260502_052251/gen_16.log:3109:    # stamp plug on top; overlap only allowed at connector docking zone (ctrl meets obj)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/21897d95/D12/0/code.py:644:def _stamp_markers_input(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/21897d95/D12/0/code.py:659:def _stamp_markers_output(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/21897d95/D12/0/code.py:768:    _stamp_markers_input(input_grid, placed_markers)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/218