r of stamp steps.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:804:# Dimension: D5 — stamp重叠处理规则 (transform)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:805:# Change: 重叠像素(被两个或以上stamp覆盖)统一着O色... → 重叠像素消失\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:832:#     - 所有 stamp 的放置窗口按新步长计算, 保证完整落在 22x22 内。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:859:def _stamp_steps(h: int, w: int) -> tuple[int, int]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:875:    step_r, step_c = _stamp_steps(h, w)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:941:    overlap: shared stamp cells cancel out instead of turning into the overlap color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:1085:    \"\"\"All cells touched by at least one output stamp.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:1086:    step_r, step_c = _stamp_steps(h, w)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:1167:    step_r, step_c = _stamp_steps(h, w)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:1219:# Change: 输出网格与输入相同(22x22)，stamp绘制在原地，未使用裁剪或扩展... → 紧凑裁剪\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:1237:#    The solver still reconstructs the stamp layout from singleton offsets and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:1239:#    The D10 change happens after stamping. Originally the solver returned the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:1242:#    bbox containing every stamped pixel. Example: if the reconstructed stamps\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:1247:#    noticeable when the stamp union sits strictly inside the 22x22 canvas, so\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82_2.txt:1248:#    the generator enforces a margin around the entire stamped union. This keeps\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_a395ee82