3640/gen_19.log:17077:+        _stamp_markers_input(input_grid, placed_markers)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_21897d95/20260506_043640/gen_19.log:17078:+        _stamp_markers_output(output_grid, placed_markers, out_colors)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_5545f144_7.txt:625:    the whole sprite body is re-stamped using that direction's template offsets and must fit in-grid.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_5545f144_7.txt:645:    markers never coincide with any stamped sprite cell at the step they belong to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_89565ca0/20260507_052240/gen_5.log:391:        # Vectorized: find wall pixel offsets and stamp color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_58f5dbd5/20260506_214633/gen_23.log:76:    Key insight: The motif acts as a stencil — it's not stamped onto the block but carved out of it as background holes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_58f5dbd5/20260506_214633/gen_23.log:527:    content: each 5x5 block carved by stamping its matching motif (centered at offset (1,1) within 5x5) as bg holes; motif cells -> bg, rest keep block color; blocks packed with 1-cell gaps preserving input row/col order; 1-cell bg border\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_58f5dbd5/20260506_214633/gen_23.log:2182:    Key insight: The motif acts as a stencil — it's not stamped onto the block but carved out of it as background holes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs_combo/f931b4a8/3.log:1740:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D5/1/code.py:24:#   original: 5-pixel plus -> phase tile -> always 16x16 lattice -> centered 6x6 maroon stamp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs_combo/f931b4a8/3.log:1741:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D5/1/code.py:25:#   variant:  5-pixel plus -> phase tile -> 15x15 lattice -> centered 6x6 maroon stamp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs_combo/f931b4a8/3.log:1742:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D5/1/code.py:26:#   The phase pattern and stamp are t